# Built by `scripts/build-corpus.sh` — a real checkout walked by Roslyn, exported as
# a store image. Not checked in for `src/wasm/`'s reason, and more so: it is a
# derived view of source that lives beside it, so a copy in git is one that goes
# stale against the code it indexes without anything noticing.
public/corpus/
